pct":195.2,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":19.4,"pe_forward":17.1,"pb_trailing":2.8,"pb_forward":2.5,"div_yield":1.2,"ps_ratio":10.9,"fcf_to_ev":5.46,"fcf_to_mcap":2.29,"liab_to_assets":33.4,"cash_to_assets":2.1,"current_ratio":4.12,"roe":14.4,"roa":9.5,"moat":{"ticker":"RS","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵產業本質上是商品化程度較高的行業，品牌定價權相對有限。RS 作為經銷商，其品牌價值主要體現在服務、可靠性和廣泛的產品線，而非獨特的產品定價能力。雖然公司能透過優質服務和供應鏈管理獲得一定溢價，但面對同業競爭和原材料價格波動，其定價權受到嚴格限制。這使得 RS 在品牌定價方面不具備顯著的護城河。","comment_en":"The steel industry is inherently commoditized, limiting brand pricing power. RS, as a distributor, derives its brand value from service, reliability, and product breadth rather than unique pricing capabilities. While superior service and supply chain management allow for some premium, intense competition and raw material price volatility severely constrain its pricing power. This limits RS's moat in brand pricing."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵經銷行業幾乎沒有專利或特許壁壘。RS 的業務模式不依賴於任何受專利保護的技術或受監管的特許經營權。其競爭優勢來自於運營效率、客戶關係和供應鏈管理，而非知識產權或政府許可。因此，在專利和監管方面，RS 幾乎沒有經濟護城河。","comment_en":"The steel distribution industry offers virtually no patent or regulatory barriers. RS's business model does not rely on patented technology or regulated franchises. Its competitive advantages stem from operational efficiency, customer relationships, and supply chain management, not intellectual property or government licenses. Consequently, RS possesses minimal economic moat in patents and regulatory aspects."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"對於許多客戶而言，更換鋼鐵經銷商的轉換成本相對較低，主要取決於價格、交貨時間和產品可用性。然而，對於需要高度定制化產品、複雜物流安排或長期穩定供應關係的大型工業客戶，更換供應商可能涉及重新認證、供應鏈重組和潛在的生產中斷風險，從而產生一定的轉換成本。RS 透過建立穩固的客戶關係和提供可靠的服務來維持客戶忠誠度。","comment_en":"For many customers, switching steel distributors involves relatively low costs, primarily driven by price, delivery time, and product availability. However, for large industrial clients requiring highly customized products, complex logistics, or long-term stable supply relationships, changing suppliers can entail recertification, supply chain restructuring, and potential production disruption risks, creating moderate switching costs. RS maintains loyalty through established relationships and reliable service."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵經銷業務不具備網絡效應。RS 的價值和競爭力主要來自於其自身的運營能力、採購網絡和客戶基礎，而非用戶數量增加帶來的網絡效應。公司與供應商和客戶的關係是雙邊的，但並不形成指數級增長的網絡價值。因此，網絡效應並非 RS 的護城河。","comment_en":"The steel distribution business does not exhibit network effects. RS's value and competitiveness stem from its operational capabilities, procurement network, and customer base, not from the value generated by an increasing number of users. While the company has bilateral relationships with suppliers and customers, these do not create exponentially growing network value. Therefore, network effects do not constitute a moat for RS."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"作為美國最大的金屬服務中心之一，RS 享有顯著的規模經濟優勢。其龐大的採購量使其能夠從鋼鐵生產商那裡獲得更優惠的價格，並透過優化物流和庫存管理來降低單位成本。這種規模使其能夠在價格競爭中保持優勢，並為客戶提供更具吸引力的報價。此外，規模還有助於公司承擔更大的訂單和更複雜的項目，這是小型競爭對手難以企及的。","comment_en":"As one of the largest metal service centers in the US, RS benefits from significant economies of scale. Its massive purchasing volume allows for more favorable pricing from steel producers and reduces per-unit costs through optimized logistics and inventory management. This scale enables competitive pricing and attractive quotes for customers. Furthermore, its size allows it to handle larger orders and more complex projects, which smaller competitors struggle to match."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"RS 在美國各地擁有廣泛的分銷網絡和倉儲設施，使其能夠高效地服務於不同地區的客戶。這種地理佈局使其能夠快速響應客戶需求，並減少運輸成本。雖然其網絡廣泛，但並非獨一無二，其他大型經銷商也可能擁有類似的地理覆蓋。然而，其在關鍵地區的戰略性資產佈局，為其提供了相對的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"RS possesses an extensive distribution network and warehousing facilities across the United States, enabling efficient service to customers in various regions. This geographic footprint allows for rapid response to customer needs and reduced transportation costs. While widespread, the network is not entirely unique, as other large distributors may have similar coverage. However, its strategic asset placement in key areas provides a relative competitive advantage."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"RS 在金屬加工和分銷領域展現出高度的運營效率。公司透過精確的庫存管理、先進的加工技術和優化的物流系統，能夠有效控制成本並提高交付準確性。其持續的流程改進和對效率的關注，使其能夠在競爭激烈的市場中保持盈利能力。這種卓越的運營能力是其核心競爭力之一，儘管其他行業參與者也在努力提升效率。","comment_en":"RS demonstrates high operational efficiency in metal processing and distribution. Through precise inventory management, advanced processing technologies, and optimized logistics, the company effectively controls costs and enhances delivery accuracy. Its continuous process improvement and focus on efficiency enable profitability in a competitive market. This operational excellence is a core competency, although other industry players also strive for efficiency gains."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"RS 在過去展現了相對穩健的資本配置能力，透過股息支付、股票回購和戰略性收購來回報股東。公司在擴張和整合方面進行了審慎的投資，以增強其市場地位和盈利能力。儘管鋼鐵行業週期性較強，影響其長期資本配置的穩定性，但管理層在維持資產負債表健康和尋求增長機會之間取得了一定的平衡。","comment_en":"RS has demonstrated a relatively sound capital allocation capability, returning value to shareholders through dividends, share buybacks, and strategic acquisitions. The company has invested prudently in expansion and integration to enhance its market position and profitability. While the cyclical nature of the steel industry impacts the stability of long-term capital allocation, management has achieved a degree of balance between maintaining a healthy balance sheet and pursuing growth opportunities."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"RS 透過提供可靠的供應、優質的客戶服務和廣泛的產品選擇來維持較高的客戶保留率。公司與客戶建立了長期的合作關係，特別是那些對供應鏈穩定性和產品質量有嚴格要求的客戶。雖然價格是重要因素，但 RS 的綜合服務能力有助於留住客戶，減少因價格波動而導致的客戶流失。","comment_en":"RS maintains a relatively high customer retention rate by offering reliable supply, quality customer service, and a broad product selection. The company fosters long-term relationships, particularly with clients who have stringent requirements for supply chain stability and product quality. While price is a factor, RS's comprehensive service capabilities help retain customers and mitigate churn due to price fluctuations."},"m10_durability":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"鋼鐵經銷行業的長期可持續性受到宏觀經濟週期、原材料價格波動和全球貿易政策的顯著影響。RS 作為行業領導者，其商業模式相對穩健，但易受外部經濟環境的影響。公司透過多元化產品和客戶群來分散風險，但其核心業務的週期性特徵限制了其護城河的長期持久性。技術變革（如新型材料）也可能對傳統鋼鐵需求構成潛在威脅。","comment_en":"The long-term durability of the steel distribution industry is significantly influenced by macroeconomic cycles, raw material price volatility, and global trade policies. As an industry leader, RS's business model is relatively robust but susceptible to external economic conditions. Diversification across products and customers mitigates some risk, but the cyclical nature of its core business limits the long-term durability of its moat. Technological changes, such as new materials, also pose potential threats to traditional steel demand."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Reliance Steel & Aluminum Co. (RS) 的護城河主要建立在其規模經濟和卓越的運營效率之上，使其在鋼鐵經銷行業中佔據領先地位。作為美國最大的金屬服務中心之一，RS 透過龐大的採購量獲得成本優勢，並透過廣泛的分銷網絡提供高效的客戶服務。這些因素共同構成了其核心競爭力，使其能夠在價格競爭中保持一定的優勢，並維持相對穩定的客戶關係。然而，鋼鐵行業的商品化屬性、對宏觀經濟週期的敏感性以及有限的品牌定價權，限制了其護城河的深度和持久性。RS 的商業模式更接近於一個高效運營的『收費橋』，依賴於交易量和運營效率來產生價值，而非擁有獨特的特許經營權或難以複製的資產。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Reliance Steel & Aluminum Co. (RS) possesses a moat primarily built on economies of scale and operational efficiency within the steel distribution sector. As one of the largest metal service centers in the US, RS leverages its massive purchasing volume for cost advantages and its extensive distribution network for efficient customer service. These elements form its core competitive strengths, enabling it to maintain pricing advantages and relatively stable customer relationships. However, the commoditized nature of steel, sensitivity to economic cycles, and limited brand pricing power cap the moat's depth and durability. RS operates more like an efficiently run 'toll bridge,' relying on volume and operational excellence for value, rather than possessing a unique franchise or irreplaceable assets.","evidenceHash":"f4a6eb5cb97fe72698d44103bd0a568ad0d8b186cfb9fce113b6f3b6f26da99a","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"315491fbc28ae6af835841d7a769b41b454424154bc44d80f84b293db191c8b0"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"315491fbc28ae6af835841d7a769b41b454424154bc44d80f84b293db191c8b0"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/RS.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/RS.png","website":"http://reliance.com","ceo":"Karla R. Lewis","full_time_employees":"15700","description":"Reliance Steel & Aluminum Co. (RS) operates as a premier diversified metal solutions provider and a leading metal service center, serving clients across the United States, Canada, and globally. The company provides an extensive inventory of approximately 100,000 metal products, including alloys, aluminum, brass, copper, carbon steel, stainless steel, titanium, and various specialty steels. Beyond distribution, it offers comprehensive metal processing services to diverse sectors such as general manufacturing, non-residential construction, transportation, aerospace, energy, electronics and semiconductor fabrication, and heavy industries. Additionally, RS supplies non-ferrous metals and tubular building products, while also manufacturing bespoke extruded metals, fabricated components, and welded parts. As of December 31, 2021, its network comprised about 315 facilities spread across 40 U.S. states and 13 other countries. The company directly sells its offerings to original equipment manufacturers, largely catering to small machine shops and fabricators. Founded in 1939, Reliance Steel & Aluminum Co. is headquartered in Los Angeles, California.","description_en":"Reliance Steel & Aluminum Co. (RS) operates as a premier diversified metal solutions provider and a leading metal service center, serving clients across the United States, Canada, and globally. The company provides an extensive inventory of approximately 100,000 metal products, including alloys, aluminum, brass, copper, carbon steel, stainless steel, titanium, and various specialty steels. Beyond distribution, it offers comprehensive metal processing services to diverse sectors such as general manufacturing, non-residential construction, transportation, aerospace, energy, electronics and semiconductor fabrication, and heavy industries. Additionally, RS supplies non-ferrous metals and tubular building products, while also manufacturing bespoke extruded metals, fabricated components, and welded parts. As of December 31, 2021, its network comprised about 315 facilities spread across 40 U.S. states and 13 other countries. The company directly sells its offerings to original equipment manufacturers, largely catering to small machine shops and fabricators. Founded in 1939, Reliance Steel & Aluminum Co. is headquartered in Los Angeles, California.","description_zh":"**Reliance Steel & Aluminum Co. (RS) 業務營運概述**\n\nReliance Steel & Aluminum Co. (RS) 為全球領先的多元金屬解決方案供應商及金屬服務中心，業務遍及美國、加拿大及全球。公司擁有約十萬種金屬產品的龐大庫存，涵蓋合金、鋁、黃銅、銅、碳鋼、不鏽鋼、鈦及多種特製鋼材。\n\n除了金屬分銷，RS 更提供全方位的金屬加工服務，以滿足通用製造、非住宅建築、運輸、航太、能源、電子與半導體製造，以及重工業等多元產業的需求。此外，公司亦供應有色金屬及管材建材，並生產客製化擠型金屬、加工組件及焊接零件。\n\n截至 2021 年 12 月 31 日，RS 的營運網絡遍布美國 40 個州及 13 個國家，共計約 315 個據點。公司主要直接銷售予原始設備製造商 (OEM)，服務對象多為小型機械加工廠及製造商。RS 成立於 1939 年，總部位於加州洛杉磯。","address":"735 